<title>GERMANY: Kuehne &amp; Nagel names new IT manager.</title>
<headline>Kuehne &amp; Nagel names new IT manager.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freight forwarding company Kuehne &amp; Nagel International AG said it has appointed Thomas Engel as its information technology manager.</p>
<p>Hamburg-based Engel will be responsible for expanding the company's communications system and developing client-specific IT services, a statement said.</p>
<p>He was previously in charge of information technology and logistics for Swiss firm AMC Alfa Metalcraft, it added. --Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
